{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChRG8KpSYaRYSJCnwhT6S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`ard setup` now sets `ARD_BOT_LOGIN` from the App's own identity and checks the bot-commits workflow on `origin/main`. `ard setup --print-workflow` prints the copy of the workflow embedded in ard. `go vet ./...`, `gofmt` on the changed files and `go test ./...` all pass.\n\n- **Variable write:** The new `SetRepoVariable` effect uses the operator's token, read only when a write happens and never logged. If the variable already holds a different value, it is replaced only after a yes at a terminal prompt. Otherwise the row is `manual` with the `gh variable set` command. A missing token or a write error also gives a `manual` row, not an abort.\n- **Workflow check:** An absent, different or unreadable workflow on `origin/main` gives a `manual` row. The embedded copy is `internal/setupcmd/workflow/bot-commits.yml`, and a test keeps it equal to the file under `.github/`.\n- **`--print-workflow`:** It runs before config load and writes only the workflow to stdout, so a redirect to a file is clean. It is rejected with `--check`, `--create-gh-app` and the App flags.\n- **Docs:** Updated `docs/proposal.md`, `docs/layout.md`, `docs/runbooks/onboard-repo.md` and `docs/site/getting-started.md`.\n\nThings that differ from the plan:\n- **Write path:** The arch test confines go-github to `internal/github`, so the write is a `SetVariable` method on `github.HTTP` (not part of `Writer`) rather than code in `internal/effects`. The App client still cannot reach it.\n- **Non-blocking rows:** The workflow and `ARD_BOT_LOGIN` rows do not block the label sync, so a missing workflow no longer stops labels from being created.\n- **Confirm prompt:** `cli.Env` has no stdin, so the prompt reads `os.Stdin` and answers no when it isn't a terminal. I added no `--yes` flag.\n- **`initcmd/body.go`:** Left unchanged.\n\nThe report is in `.ard/348/worker-engineer.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1426,"cache_read_input_tokens":70382,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1426},"output_tokens":719,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c27803e8-8eaa-4bd3-a933-2e231528c769","uuid":"93078d75-6901-4794-ab38-dd03e126e0f4","timestamp":"2026-11-26T08:57:02.249Z","request_id":"req_011ChRG8KgVZb6fJms7jCwJu"}
